ORDINANCE NO. ____________________

ENTITLED:
“AN ORDINANCE AMENDING TITLE 17, ZONING, CHAPTER 17.08,
ZONING
DISTRICTS
ESTABLISHED,
AND
SECTION
17.08.040,
CHEYENNE CITY MAP, OF THE CHEYENNE CITY CODE, BY
CHANGING THE ZONING CLASSIFICATION FROM MUB MIXED USE
WITH
BUSINESS
EMPHASIS
AND
MR-2
MEDIUM
DENSITY
RESIDENTIAL – DEVELOPING DISTRICTS TO CB COMMUNITY
BUSINESS DISTRICT FOR LOTS 1-10, BLOCK ONE, COLLEGE
BUSINESS PARK, 3RD FILING, CHEYENNE, WYOMING (LOCATED
EAST OF AND ADJACENT TO N. COLLEGE DRIVE, BETWEEN
LARAMIE AND CHARLES STREETS).”

BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING:

Section 1.

That in accordance with Title 17 Zoning, Chapter 17.08 Zoning Districts
Established and Section 17.08.040 Cheyenne city map of the Cheyenne City Code, for the area and
property described as Lots 1-10, Block One, College Business Park, 3rd Filing, Cheyenne, Wyoming be
changed to CB Community Business District.

Section 2.

That the zone change was recommended for approval to CB Community
Business District by the City of Cheyenne Planning Commission on March 5, 2012, pursuant to Section
17.148.060B(1&3) of the Cheyenne City Code.

Section 3.

That the City Engineer or his designated representative alter and amend the
adopted zoning map as described in Section 17.08.040 Cheyenne city map of the Cheyenne City Code,
to comply with the change of zone as described in Section 1 of this ordinance upon notification by the
City Clerk’s office of publication of said ordinance.

Section 4.

Sections, paragraphs, sentences, clauses and phrases of this ordinance are
severable. If any phrase, clause, sentence, paragraph or section of this ordinance is declared
unconstitutional, such unconstitutionality shall not affect any of the remaining phrases, clauses,
sentences, paragraphs and sections.

Section 5.

That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon its publication and
official filing of affiliated College Business Park, 3rd Filing final plat map with the County Clerk and
Ex-Officio Register of Deeds for Laramie County, Wyoming.

FIRST READING:

______________________________________________

SECOND READING:

______________________________________________

THIRD AND FINAL READING:
______________________________________________

______________________________________________

RICHARD L. KAYSEN, MAYOR

(SEAL)
ATTEST:

___________________________________
CAROL INTLEKOFER, CITY CLERK

publish date:  ________________________
